\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Per-event paired differences with 95 percent confidence intervals, the pooled mean, and the shaded band below the minimum detectable effect. Per-event intervals use two degrees of freedom and are correspondingly wide; they indicate shape, not per-event significance. \textbf  {Exploratory presentation of the pre-registered quantity; the confirmatory result is Table~\ref {tab:primary}.}}}{8}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:forest}{{4}{8}{The pre-registered comparison}{figure.4}{}}
